00:03:33.805 --> 00:03:36.399
 30% de un, 
17,1% de deux,

00:03:36.399 --> 00:03:38.861
11,5% de trois, 
9,6% de quatre,

00:03:38.861 --> 00:03:41.921
8,5% de cinq, 
